{"steam_appid":3819640,"steam_name":"Megastore Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3819640/593796533/2406e6ed1e7350630d61b5138b23193e0133c9bb/1775091822/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1775155716","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257215838/ff2e5f3d86c64eb0646e0422c89f8bfad070eb0c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1775155716","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/6e4d1e76934e5f4d959d9a0591cc1fb70d882ad6/ss_6e4d1e76934e5f4d959d9a0591cc1fb70d882ad6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786139057","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/4938e2f8163d9b842f0181614e9638088fb14563/ss_4938e2f8163d9b842f0181614e9638088fb14563.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786139057","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/c28791d6c6dd2b7a2e2f80d846532648f99277af/ss_c28791d6c6dd2b7a2e2f80d846532648f99277af.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786139057","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/f1d99727f981cc30e3d76b406b32bb6578f2457a/ss_f1d99727f981cc30e3d76b406b32bb6578f2457a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786139057","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/4022352d6fd40e1330b5a98f94111e76c8e7e9cd/ss_4022352d6fd40e1330b5a98f94111e76c8e7e9cd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786139057"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR MEGASTORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with <strong>$400</strong>; choose a department from <strong>clothing, toys, bakery, sports, grocery, music</strong>, buy your first shelves and products, open for business, and grow.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/069ddb4550ebf84bd02c19e2189379bc.poster.avif?t=1786139057\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/069ddb4550ebf84bd02c19e2189379bc.webm?t=1786139057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/069ddb4550ebf84bd02c19e2189379bc.mp4?t=1786139057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEEP EVERY SHELF STOCKED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor all departments, refill shortages fast, and don’t miss sales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/a2222be7145805e1dc3627fbe66d8538.poster.avif?t=1786139057\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/a2222be7145805e1dc3627fbe66d8538.webm?t=1786139057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/a2222be7145805e1dc3627fbe66d8538.mp4?t=1786139057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEPARTMENT-SPECIFIC FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each department comes with its own mechanics. In the bakery, order dough, purchase an oven, and bake your products. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/1d73b13f22f001b6b29ce989302e0631.poster.avif?t=1786139057\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/1d73b13f22f001b6b29ce989302e0631.webm?t=1786139057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/1d73b13f22f001b6b29ce989302e0631.mp4?t=1786139057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STOCK MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track shelves in real time, top up any missing items, and unload trucks quickly with a hand truck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/f3b2b007215cba818dbb78db723a55d4.poster.avif?t=1786139057\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/f3b2b007215cba818dbb78db723a55d4.webm?t=1786139057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/f3b2b007215cba818dbb78db723a55d4.mp4?t=1786139057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROW &amp; EXPAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your megastore in any direction by purchasing new sections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/3ffe606644ad3eb8da1eb95b3d289523.poster.avif?t=1786139057\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/3ffe606644ad3eb8da1eb95b3d289523.webm?t=1786139057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/3ffe606644ad3eb8da1eb95b3d289523.mp4?t=1786139057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OPEN THE SECOND FLOOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the upper floor to offer more space to your customers. Place departments wherever you like and make sure everything stays accessible.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/1c60c485a153244b64208ec7ee3ff681.poster.avif?t=1786139057\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/1c60c485a153244b64208ec7ee3ff681.webm?t=1786139057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/1c60c485a153244b64208ec7ee3ff681.mp4?t=1786139057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire cashiers, stockers, bakers, and more; manage shifts and performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/8a62a642cf7aef13416d279b388fe579.poster.avif?t=1786139057\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/8a62a642cf7aef13416d279b388fe579.webm?t=1786139057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/8a62a642cf7aef13416d279b388fe579.mp4?t=1786139057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SERVICE ROOM &amp; WAREHOUSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/488abf7739726ed7b54a4ce48fae2098.poster.avif?t=1786139057\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/488abf7739726ed7b54a4ce48fae2098.webm?t=1786139057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/488abf7739726ed7b54a4ce48fae2098.mp4?t=1786139057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A massive warehouse with 4 truck loading bays and access to both floors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy warehouse equipment like a pallet robot, forklift, and pallet jack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the entire operation with stock control panels and warehouse displays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep items like computers and cleaning supplies in the service room to keep your store organized!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>AND MUCH MORE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attract more customers</strong> to your megastore with <strong>ads and product promotions</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your store to life with <strong>talking, reactive NPCs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost satisfaction with a <strong>returns desk</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy <strong>recycling bins</strong> and <strong>turn empty boxes into cash</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate your megastore</strong> the way you like with <strong>department-specific decorations and furniture</strong>: fitting rooms, various wall and floor customizations, a bakery <strong>tray rack</strong>, and much more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  i5 3550 / RYZEN 5 2500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 7600K / Ryzen 5 2600x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA GTX 1060 3GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["Yolo Games Studio"],"publishers":["Yolo Games Studio"],"release_date":"Feb 2, 2026"}